If the RGoogleDocs <https://github.com/duncantl/RGoogleDocs> package was installed from GitHub using a version of devtools < 1.4, you will need to reinstall it from GitHub using devtools >= 1.4.

For example:

devtools::install_github('duncantl/RGoogleDocs')

Let me know if that helps.

-Andy

